  "description": "Quick Brain: Number Hunt is a brain-training game where you search for the target number hidden among a screen full of colorful digits.\n\nThe rule is simple: find the specified number—that’s it!\nIgnore distracting sizes, colors, and layouts, and rely on your focus and observation skills to lock onto the correct answer.\n\nWith timed stages, your quick thinking and speed are put to the test.\nIncludes 150 stages. Quick to pick up, satisfying to clear—perfect for short breaks, and surprisingly addictive even after a long day.",
